Third-party notices

Kopia is Copyright its upstream authors and is distributed under
Apache-2.0. This repository packages the official container image
`kopia/kopia:20261110.0.231742`
(`kopia/kopia@sha256:efc5fd7aa9df34f5513a6ef2253adf9601b96ca50edeba78f6dc8e3069baac2f`)
from Docker Hub unmodified; no upstream source code is distributed here.

The package also runs the unmodified Docker Official Image
`caddy:2.11.4-alpine` (Apache-2.0, Caddy authors) as an internal web front that
serves a public landing page and reverse-proxies the Kopia UI.

The Ubuntu 22.04 base of the Kopia image and the Alpine base of the Caddy image
ship their own components under their own licences (GPL-2.0, LGPL-2.1, BSD,
MIT, OpenSSL, …); they are not redistributed by this repository.

All trademarks belong to their owners. This is an independent community
package, not affiliated with the upstream projects or TerraMaster.
See NOTICE.md for the full attribution table.

TOSAppSelfTestingTool is an official TerraMaster utility, redistributed here
unmodified for local package validation (not shipped inside the package).
